# fix1 round 2, flow "fix1_monsters" run 2 (test database, homelands on, real time): the level-10 Aydor
# warrior "Samanci" in Tanyeri walks up to the two reshaped homeland monsters - Anız Yanığı (straw
# scarecrow) and Yanık Nöbetçi (banner-bearer) - lets each come and strike (walk / attack), then kills it
# (death clip on the ground).
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text fix1_monsters
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charselect+idle+chars2 900
clickon select.slot0
wait 5
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle+invloaded+zone2 1800
expect world+level10
waitfor world+ready+nobanner 600

# ---- Anız Yanığı ----
scene walkpath 197 340
waitfor world+nodest+standing 3600
waitfor world+monsters 600
scene walktomonster Anız Yanığı 9
waitfor world+nodest+standing 2400
scene target nearest Anız Yanığı
scene camera behind 20 7
wait 20
screenshot 30_tanyeri_stubble_thrall_1_idle.png
scene walktomonster Anız Yanığı 4
waitfor world+nodest+standing 1200
waitfor world+hitstaken1 1200
scene camera side 18 6
wait 4
screenshot 30_tanyeri_stubble_thrall_2_attack.png
scene target nearest Anız Yanığı
key f
waitfor world+kills1 3600
wait 30
scene camera side 24 6
wait 5
screenshot 30_tanyeri_stubble_thrall_3_death.png

# ---- Yanık Nöbetçi (scorched fields, west) ----
scene walkpath 185 285
waitfor world+nodest+standing 3600
scene walkpath 145 218.5
waitfor world+nodest+standing 3600
scene walktomonster Yanık Nöbetçi 9
waitfor world+nodest+standing 2400
scene target nearest Yanık Nöbetçi
scene camera behind 20 7
wait 20
screenshot 31_tanyeri_burnt_sentry_1_idle.png
scene walktomonster Yanık Nöbetçi 4
waitfor world+nodest+standing 1200
waitfor world+hitstaken2 1200
scene camera side 18 6
wait 4
screenshot 31_tanyeri_burnt_sentry_2_attack.png
scene target nearest Yanık Nöbetçi
key f
waitfor world+kills2 3600
wait 30
scene camera side 24 6
wait 5
screenshot 31_tanyeri_burnt_sentry_3_death.png
quit
